A strategy for synthesis of large-scale lamellar Mn MOFs via modulated bi-phase system has been developed. The continuous ligand supply along with capping agent are highly effective in promoting the layer-by-layer growth and achieving large crystal sizes. The stabilized lamellar morphology enables the first demonstration of bromine intercalation on layered MOFs.
